1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,987
For agents, vigo runs as an MCP server.

2
00:00:03,987 --> 00:00:11,112
Fourteen tools cover project creation, scene writing, clip editing, rendering, probing, and conversion.

3
00:00:11,112 --> 00:00:20,925
The vigo guide resource carries the schema and the seek contract, so an agent can write, render, inspect, and iterate without a human in the loop.

